\"card\"><h3>The area measured</h3><p class=\"sub\">1-bedroom villas within 5 km of Sayan, a circle that takes in central Ubud. The dot is The Ridge.</p><div id=\"report-map\"></div></div><div class=\"card\"><h3>The Ridge in this market</h3><p class=\"sub\">Public information, read on 24 November 2026.</p><div class=\"rfacts\"><div class=\"f\"><span>Guest rating</span><span>9.8 from 139 reviews (Booking.com)</span></div><div class=\"f\"><span>Recognition</span><span>One MICHELIN Key, 2026 selection</span></div><div class=\"f\"><span>Published rate</span><span>From IDR 8.7M a night, taxes included (Mr &amp; Mrs Smith)</span></div><div class=\"f\"><span>Against the area</span><span>Several times the area&#x27;s average rate</span></div><div class=\"f\"><span>Found on</span><span>Booking.com, Expedia, Agoda, Trip.com, Traveloka, Mr &amp; Mrs Smith</span></div><div class=\"f\"><span>Not found on</span><span>Some other major OTAs</span></div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"reads\"><div class=\"card\"><h4>A clear season</h4><p>The area peaks in July, August, September (52 to 58% occupancy) and is softest in November, December, January (40 to 44%).</p></div><div class=\"card\"><h4>Guests book late</h4><p>Depending on the month, the median booking is made 9 to 21 days before arrival. On 24 November, 13% of the area&#x27;s December nights were booked; last December finished at 40%. Most of the coming months is still to be sold.</p></div><div class=\"card\"><h4>More choice for guests</h4><p>Over twelve months the average rate booked in the area was 9% lower than the year before, and occupancy 1.8 points lower. With this much supply, visibility and reputation decide who gets the booking.</p></div></div>\n<details><summary>View the data</summary><table><thead><tr><th>Month</th><th>Occupancy</th><th>Year before</th><th>ADR (IDR)</th><th>Year before</th><th>Booking window (days)</th><th>Stay (nights)</th><th>Active listings</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td data-l='Month'>Nov 2025